# The Remote Viewer

A zero-trust, local-first decentralized application engineered with integrated hemispheric synchronization and consciousness patterning pipelines.

## System Overview
Operates entirely on a local-first, decentralized architecture. Combines self-hosted audio processing with advanced meditative state mapping derived from the Monroe Institute and declassified CIA findings.

## Core Architecture & Security Model
* Zero-Trust Execution: All application logic and audio synthesis run locally within an isolated sandboxed client environment.
* Decentralized Node Integration: Self-hosted local nodes handle data validation utilizing cryptographic verification hashes.
* Air-Gapped Privacy: Designed with a strict isolation barrier akin to a Faraday cage.

## Consciousness & Hemi-Sync Pipeline
* Binaural Engine: Lossless audio streams delivering precise carrier offset frequencies ($3Hz$ to $8Hz$ theta range).
* Focus State Mapping: Progressive mapping across Focus 10, 12, 15, and 21.
* Patterning Execution: Structured mental visualization and localized frequency projection.

